<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width:760px">
    <p><strong>The short version:</strong> we collect an email address only when you choose to give us one, we use it to send our newsletter, we never sell or rent it, and this is a family-friendly site so we take children's privacy seriously.</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Made Out of Clay Productions is an independent children's picture-book imprint (pen name Isaiah Hartwell). You can reach us any time at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your email address</strong> — when you subscribe to our newsletter or send us a message. Newsletter subscriptions are managed by our email provider, Beehiiv.</li>
      <li><strong>Anything you put in the contact form</strong> — your name, email, and message, so we can reply.</li>
      <li><strong>Basic, aggregate analytics</strong> — only after you accept our cookie banner. We use Google Analytics and the Meta Pixel to understand general traffic; they are not loaded until you consent.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We never sell, rent, or trade your information.</li>
      <li>We don't load analytics or advertising cookies until you opt in.</li>
      <li>We don't knowingly collect personal information from children. Our books are for kids, but our site and sign-ups are meant for the grown-ups who buy and read them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is intended to be used by adults (parents, caregivers, educators, librarians, press). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us information, email us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some links to books are Amazon affiliate links (tag <code>{{ site.associateTag }}</code>). If you buy through them we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. See our <a href="/books/">books</a> and each product page for details.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Unsubscribe from the newsletter any time using the link in any email.</li>
      <li>Decline analytics by not accepting the cookie banner (or clearing cookies).</li>
      <li>Ask us to access or delete your data by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the site grows; we'll revise the date above when we do.</p>
